WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:03.221
Learn money skills. Play. Save. Grow together.

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:07.416
Create a practice wallet. Add a name, your relationship,

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:09.506
and a companion. For adult learners,

00:00:09.506 --> 00:00:11.731
confirm they agreed to share activity.

00:00:12.547 --> 00:00:15.528
Give the learner Brotes. Choose an amount and confirm.

00:00:15.528 --> 00:00:17.990
These practice coins have no monetary value.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.362
Create a goal, set its target, and move Brotes

00:00:21.362 --> 00:00:23.469
into savings. The progress bar shows

00:00:23.469 --> 00:00:24.624
how far you've come.

00:00:25.447 --> 00:00:28.225
Open Market Adventure. Move with arrows or tap a

00:00:28.225 --> 00:00:31.837
stall. Compare prices, buy essentials, and return items when

00:00:31.837 --> 00:00:35.172
you change your mind. Finish three rounds within budget,

00:00:35.172 --> 00:00:37.881
then claim a practice reward once per profile.

00:00:39.547 --> 00:00:42.695
In Goal Island, earn coins, cover essentials, and build

00:00:42.695 --> 00:00:45.776
an emergency reserve. Use that reserve to repair storm

00:00:45.776 --> 00:00:48.522
damage. Save for the bridge to reach the treasure

00:00:48.522 --> 00:00:50.800
garden. Game coins stay inside the game.

00:00:51.847 --> 00:00:55.951
Digital Detective teaches online safety. Choose the safest response,

00:00:55.951 --> 00:00:58.756
check your answers, and review the explanation.

00:00:59.547 --> 00:01:02.348
Practice a purchase. Enter what you're buying, pick a

00:01:02.348 --> 00:01:04.901
category, and choose the amount. Approval keeps

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:07.516
the guardian involved before funds are deducted.

00:01:08.313 --> 00:01:11.838
Open Activity to approve or reject requests. Filter by

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:14.826
learner, review the history, and export a CSV.

00:01:15.613 --> 00:01:18.599
Set a spending limit, require approval, or pause practice

00:01:18.599 --> 00:01:20.975
actions in each learner's Guidance settings.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:24.975
Ready for Solana? Choose Mainnet or Testnet. Test SOL

00:01:24.975 --> 00:01:27.390
is for testing and has no monetary value.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:31.802
This local test wallet shows the guardian-controlled account. Each

00:01:31.802 --> 00:01:33.550
profile has its own address; real

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.173
transactions require the guardian's signature.

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:40.096
Enter an amount and destination. The deposit review shows

00:01:40.096 --> 00:01:42.894
addresses and a network fee notice. We cancel before

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:46.329
wallet signing. Withdrawal details can be entered separately.

00:01:47.113 --> 00:01:51.325
These are earlier testnet transactions, verified on Solana Explorer.

00:01:51.325 --> 00:01:52.869
Open a receipt to check the

00:01:52.869 --> 00:01:55.396
amount, signature, and finalized status.

00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:59.638
Save a backup of profiles, goals, and activity. Preview

00:01:59.638 --> 00:02:01.993
it before restoring. Here, we keep the

00:02:01.993 --> 00:02:04.421
current data. Keys stay in your wallet.

00:02:05.213 --> 00:02:08.985
Switch demo perspectives to explore the learner's view. Simple

00:02:08.985 --> 00:02:13.385
mode reduces visual complexity. Choose English, Spanish, or Portuguese.

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:16.518
Start with practice. Create your circle.

00:02:16.518 --> 00:02:18.590
Your next adventure starts in Brote.
